            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oyuncunun <code>ammo</code> değerinin <code>13</code>'e eşit olup olmadığını kontrol et ve sonucu <code>correctAmmo</code> değişkeninde sakla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"correctAnswer\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctAmmo = ammo === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(correctAmmo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>===</code> ve son olarak <code>13</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
